+/* node test/run-override.test.js — the one-run {model, provider, effort} rule (CA PHE DIGITAL, company/patches/0017).
+   sidecar/run-override.js parses and checks an override; team.dispatch (tools/builtin/orchestration.js) applies one per
+   worker against a FAKE runOnce: the worker with an override runs on it, the one beside it without one keeps its own
